 "note": "Where each published image came from: all twelve built in one pass by `cargo xtask build-images esp` from a clean rind-bench tree at the commit given, the rind submodule at its pin with patches/0001-0004 applied and ring vendored with ring-0.17.14-xtensa-poly1305-align.patch. Builds are not bit-reproducible (ESP-IDF stamps the build time into the app descriptor), so the sha256 identifies the image that ran. Flashed with --flash-freq 80mhz. The `rind_bench` commit IDs name the private steelhead99x/rind-bench history; that repo was archived and published as steelhead99x/rind-hardware (squash root 8d9c1bb5e76e5ae8eb2d481535dc63ccd6a8f5f3) and those IDs are not in the public history.",
